    "details": {
      "cr": 0.5,
      "type": {
        "value": "custom",
        "subtype": "",
        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Castanha Espinhosa. Quando Chespin enrijece o corpo antes de dar uma cabeçada, os espinhos de sua cabeça ficam pontiagudos e perfuram o inimigo no impacto. Comer muitas frutas fortalece a casca que protege sua cabeça e seu corpo.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Chespin pode evoluir para Quilladin no nível 6 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Growl, Vine Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Rollout</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Bite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Leech Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Pin Missile</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Seed Bomb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Mud Shot</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Bulk Up</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Body Slam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Pain Split, Wood Hammer</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Attract, Body Slam, Brick Break, Bulk Up, Bulldoze, Bullet Seed, Confide, Curse, Dig, Double Team, Drain Punch, Dual Chop, Endeavor, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Fling, Focus Punch, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grass Pledge, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Gyro Ball, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Iron Defense, Iron Head, Iron Tail, Leaf Storm, Low Kick, Low Sweep, Magical Leaf, Metal Claw, Mud Shot, Nature Power, Pain Split, Payback, Poison Jab, Protect, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Return, Roar, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Seed Bomb, Shadow Claw, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Smack Down, Snore, Solar Beam, Spikes, Stomping Tantrum, Stone Edge, Substitute, Sunny Day, Super Fang, Superpower, Swagger, Swift, Swords Dance, Synthesis, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thunder Punch, Toxic, Trailblaze, Work Up, Worry Seed, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Belly Drum, Curse, Defense Curl, Power-Up Punch, Quick Guard, Rollout, Spikes, Super Fang, Synthesis, Wide Guard</p>",
